      "rationale": "The Mass Schedule box lists 'Saturday after 1st Friday: 24-hr Adoration Only: 9:00 AM'. Guardian sign-ups span Friday to Saturday (Nov 6/7), so 9:00 AM Saturday may be where the 24 hours END, not start; the start time on Friday is not printed. 'Saturday after 1st Friday' is the first Saturday except when the first Friday is the 7th, so it only approximates weeks_of_month first. The 09-27 bulletin shows a 9:00 AM Saturday Mass intention on Oct 3, so a Mass that day was also possible. Only the 10-04 history event has it in one bulletin of three; the box is in all three.\n\nReview 2026-10-22: Exclude the offered first-Saturday 9 AM start. It may be the END of a Friday–Saturday vigil, and Saturday after first Friday is not always first Saturday. This reverses the agent’s lean.",
